                   "PrimaryDefinition":  "\u003col\u003e\u003cli data-details=\"Jitendex.org [2025-02-11]\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"dict-group__tag-list\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"dict-group__tag dict-group__tag--name\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"dict-group__tag-inner\"\u003e★\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"dict-group__tag dict-group__tag--dict\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"dict-group__tag-inner\"\u003eJitendex.org [2025-02-11]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"dict-group__glossary\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan data-sc-code=\"v5u\" title=\"Godan verb with \u0027u\u0027 ending\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em; color: white; background-color: rgb(86, 86, 86); vertical-align: text-bottom; border-radius: 0.3em; margin-right: 0.25em; padding: 0.2em 0.3em; word-break: keep-all; cursor: help;\"\u003e5-dan\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-sc-code=\"vt\" title=\"transitive verb\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.8em; color: white; background-color: rgb(86, 86, 86); vertical-align: text-bottom; border-radius: 0.3em; margin-right: 0.25em; padding: 0.2em 0.3em; word-break: keep-all; cursor: help;\"\u003etransitive\u003c/span\u003e\u003col\u003e\u003cli style=\"padding-left: 0.25em; list-style-type: \u0026quot;①\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003cul data-sc-content=\"glossary\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eto pick up\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eto gather\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"extra-info\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5em;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence\" data-sc-source=\"146484\" style=\"background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)) 5%, transparent); border-color: var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)); border-style: none none none solid; border-radius: 0.4rem; border-width: calc(3em / var(--font-size-no-units, 14)); margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding: 0.5rem;\"\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence-a\" lang=\"ja\" style=\"font-size: 1.3em;\"\u003e\u003cruby lang=\"ja\"\u003e床\u003crt lang=\"ja\"\u003eゆか\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eからペンを\u003cspan data-sc-content=\"example-keyword\" lang=\"ja\" style=\"color: color-mix(in srgb, lime, var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)));\"\u003e\u003cruby lang=\"ja\"\u003e拾\u003crt lang=\"ja\"\u003eひろ\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eって\u003c/span\u003e\u003cruby lang=\"ja\"\u003e下\u003crt lang=\"ja\"\u003eくだ\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eさい。\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence-b\" style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\"\u003ePlease pick up the pen from the floor.\u003cspan data-sc-content=\"attribution-footnote\" style=\"font-size: 0.8em; color: rgb(119, 119, 119); vertical-align: top; margin-left: 0.25rem;\"\u003e[1]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"padding-left: 0.25em; list-style-type: \u0026quot;②\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003cul data-sc-content=\"glossary\" style=\"padding-left: 0px; list-style-type: none;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eto find (and pick up; something someone has dropped)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"extra-info\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5em;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence\" data-sc-source=\"221895\" style=\"background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)) 5%, transparent); border-color: var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)); border-style: none none none solid; border-radius: 0.4rem; border-width: calc(3em / var(--font-size-no-units, 14)); margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding: 0.5rem;\"\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence-a\" lang=\"ja\" style=\"font-size: 1.3em;\"\u003eこの\u003cruby lang=\"ja\"\u003e財\u003crt lang=\"ja\"\u003eさい\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003e\u003cruby lang=\"ja\"\u003e布\u003crt lang=\"ja\"\u003eふ\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eはどこで\u003cspan data-sc-content=\"example-keyword\" lang=\"ja\" style=\"color: color-mix(in srgb, lime, var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)));\"\u003e\u003cruby lang=\"ja\"\u003e拾\u003crt lang=\"ja\"\u003eひろ\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eった\u003c/span\u003eのですか。\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence-b\" style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\"\u003eWhere did you find this wallet?\u003cspan data-sc-content=\"attribution-footnote\" style=\"font-size: 0.8em; color: rgb(119, 119, 119); vertical-align: top; margin-left: 0.25rem;\"\u003e[2]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"padding-left: 0.25em; list-style-type: \u0026quot;③\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003cul data-sc-content=\"glossary\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eto select\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eto choose\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eto pick out\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"padding-left: 0.25em; list-style-type: \u0026quot;④\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003cul data-sc-content=\"glossary\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eto get (unexpectedly)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eto hit upon (luck, an opportunity, etc.)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eto snatch (an unexpected victory)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eto pull off\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"padding-left: 0.25em; list-style-type: \u0026quot;⑤\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003cul data-sc-content=\"glossary\" style=\"padding-left: 0px; list-style-type: none;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eto pick up (someone; in a car, etc.)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"extra-info\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5em;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence\" data-sc-source=\"196196\" style=\"background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)) 5%, transparent); border-color: var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)); border-style: none none none solid; border-radius: 0.4rem; border-width: calc(3em / var(--font-size-no-units, 14)); margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding: 0.5rem;\"\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence-a\" lang=\"ja\" style=\"font-size: 1.3em;\"\u003eホテルの\u003cruby lang=\"ja\"\u003e前\u003crt lang=\"ja\"\u003eまえ\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eで\u003cruby lang=\"ja\"\u003e私\u003crt lang=\"ja\"\u003eわたし\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eを\u003cruby lang=\"ja\"\u003e車\u003crt lang=\"ja\"\u003eくるま\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eで\u003cspan data-sc-content=\"example-keyword\" lang=\"ja\" style=\"color: color-mix(in srgb, lime, var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)));\"\u003e\u003cruby lang=\"ja\"\u003e拾\u003crt lang=\"ja\"\u003eひろ\u003c/rt\u003e\u003c/ruby\u003eって\u003c/span\u003eください。\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence-b\" style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\"\u003ePlease pick me up by car in front of the hotel.\u003cspan data-sc-content=\"attribution-footnote\" style=\"font-size: 0.8em; color: rgb(119, 119, 119); vertical-align: top; margin-left: 0.25rem;\"\u003e[3]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"padding-left: 0.25em; list-style-type: \u0026quot;⑥\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003cul data-sc-content=\"glossary\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eto flag down (a taxi)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eto hail\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"extra-info\" style=\"margin-left: 0.5em;\"\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence\" data-sc-source=\"122758\" style=\"background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)) 5%, transparent); border-color: var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)); border-style: none none none solid; border-radius: 0.4rem; border-width: calc(3em / var(--font-size-no-units, 14)); margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; padding: 0.5rem;\"\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence-a\" lang=\"ja\" style=\"font-size: 1.3em;\"\u003e日本では昼間でも夜でもタクシーを\u003cspan lang=\"ja\" style=\"color: color-mix(in srgb, lime, var(--text-color, var(--fg, #333)));\"\u003e拾う\u003c/span\u003eことができる。\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"example-sentence-b\" style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\"\u003eIn Japan you can always catch a cab, day or night.\u003cspan data-sc-content=\"attribution-footnote\" style=\"font-size: 0.8em; color: rgb(119, 119, 119); vertical-align: top; margin-left: 0.25rem;\"\u003e[4]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"padding-left: 0.25em; list-style-type: \u0026quot;⑦\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003cul data-sc-content=\"glossary\" style=\"padding-left: 0px; list-style-type: none;\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eto pick up (a signal, sound, interference, etc.)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"padding-left: 0.25em; list-style-type: \u0026quot;⑧\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003cul data-sc-content=\"glossary\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eto (just manage to) return (the ball)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eto return (a difficult shot)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"padding-left: 0.25em; list-style-type: \u0026quot;⑨\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003cul data-sc-content=\"glossary\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eto take on (someone in adverse circumstances)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eto employ\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eto give a job\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eto take in\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"padding-left: 0.25em; list-style-type: \u0026quot;⑩\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003cul data-sc-content=\"glossary\"\u003e\u003cli\u003eto walk\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eto go on foot\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv data-sc-content=\"attribution\" style=\"font-size: 0.7em; text-align: right;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.edrdg.org/jmwsgi/entr.py?svc=jmdict\u0026amp;q=1332570\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eJMdict\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"display:none;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e | Tatoeba \u003ca href=\"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/146484\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003e[1]\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style